From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cool-retro-term-wezterm <build@localhost>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:16:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] Add cool-retro-term CRT post-processing to the OpenGL
 renderer

- config.crt: cool-retro-term profile + per-effect overrides
- crt_profiles.rs: the 14 built-in cool-retro-term profiles (generated)
- wezterm-gui/src/crt: offscreen scene + bloom, burn-in, frame, static and
  dynamic passes ported from cool-retro-term's shaders (GLSL 330)
- keep repainting at crt.fps while the effects are enabled
- cool-retro-term icon for the exe and the window

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 assets/icon/terminal.png                   | Bin 9259 -> 3144 bytes
 assets/windows/terminal.ico                | Bin 165530 -> 10509 bytes
 config/src/config.rs                       |   4 +
 config/src/crt.rs                          | 257 +++++++++++++
